      subject: Subject.science,
      chapterId: "sci_ch_05_life_processes",
      questionText: "[NCERT Exercise 2] Element X forms a chloride with the formula \$\\text{XCl}_2\$, which is a solid with a high melting point. X would most likely be in the same group of the Periodic Table as:",
