      questionText: "[NCERT Exercise 6] The positions of three elements A, B, and C in the Periodic Table are shown below:\nGroup 16: -, -, B\nGroup 17: -, A, -, C\nWhich statement correctly describes the properties of A, B, and C?",
      options: const [
